# Findings memo: do our sales and payment numbers agree?

**To:** Operations and Finance leads · **Re:** Olist orders {{ dataset.first_purchase_date }} to {{ dataset.last_purchase_date }} · **Currency:** Brazilian real (R$, BRL)

## Bottom line

The two systems agree on **{{ reconciliation.match_rate_pct | pct }}** of {{ reconciliation.orders_total | int }} orders. The {{ reconciliation.orders_unmatched | int }} that do not agree add up to **{{ reconciliation.abs_gap_brl | brl }}**, about {{ reconciliation.abs_gap_pct_of_paid | pct }} of the {{ reconciliation.paid_brl | brl }} customers paid.

Almost all of that money is one problem: **{{ reconciliation.missing_items.paid_brl | brl }} was paid on {{ reconciliation.missing_items.orders | int }} orders that have no items recorded.** {{ reconciliation.missing_items.canceled_or_unavailable_pct | pct }} of those orders were canceled or marked unavailable. We cannot see from this data whether those customers were refunded.

Everything else is small and has a clear cause. Only **{{ reconciliation.orders_unexplained | int }} orders ({{ reconciliation.unexplained_abs_gap_brl | brl }})** have no explanation.

## What we found

| Cause | Orders | Money | What it means |
|---|---:|---:|---|
| Paid, but no items recorded | {{ reconciliation.missing_items.orders | int }} | {{ reconciliation.missing_items.paid_brl | brl }} | Canceled/unavailable orders still show a payment. Refund status unknown. |
| Card interest on installment plans | {{ reconciliation.by_category.installment_interest.orders? | int }} | {{ reconciliation.by_category.installment_interest.abs_gap_brl? | brl }} | Customers who split card payments pay extra, on a fixed rate table. The order system does not record it. Normal, but it makes totals disagree. |
| Discounts not recorded on the order | {{ reconciliation.by_category.untracked_discount.orders? | int }} | {{ reconciliation.by_category.untracked_discount.abs_gap_brl? | brl }} | Customers paid exactly 5% or 10% less than the price. The discount lives only in the payment. |
| Voucher splits | {{ reconciliation.by_category.voucher_related.orders? | int }} | {{ reconciliation.by_category.voucher_related.abs_gap_brl? | brl }} | Card + voucher payments that overshoot the order total. |
| Cent-level rounding | {{ reconciliation.by_category.rounding.orders? | int }} | {{ reconciliation.by_category.rounding.abs_gap_brl? | brl }} | Harmless. |
| No payment recorded | {{ reconciliation.by_category.missing_payment.orders? | int }} | {{ reconciliation.by_category.missing_payment.abs_gap_brl? | brl }} | Goods recorded, no payment. |
